From: Elektrobit <info@elektrobit.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add custom EXTRAVERSION tag

Add "-custom" to EXTRAVERSION so the rebuilt kernel is
identifiable via uname -r.

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@
 VERSION = 6
 PATCHLEVEL = 12
 SUBLEVEL = 94
-EXTRAVERSION =
+EXTRAVERSION = -custom
 NAME = Baby Opossum Posse

 # *DOCUMENTATION*
